# The key map under h: the common keys first, then the advanced ones.

Type "h"
Sleep 2s
Screenshot {{SHOTS}}/01-common-keys.png
Sleep 1s

Type "enter the next"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Screenshot {{SHOTS}}/02-enter-the-next-session.png
Sleep 1s

Escape
Sleep 600ms
Type "/"
Sleep 600ms
Type "advanced: the list"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Screenshot {{SHOTS}}/03-advanced-list.png
Sleep 1s
